OL,3,GNEWSAArchers fans urged to back fight  
OL,4,Ato keep show in city                   
OL,6,FAudiences attending the final          
OL,7,Fperformances of The Archers' 75th      
OL,8,Fanniversary roadshows are being urged  
OL,9,Fto back a campaign to keep the         
OL,10,Flong-running soap in Birmingham.       
OL,12,FThe BBC has shelved plans to build a   
OL,13,Fdrama studio at its new base in the    
OL,14,Fcity - which entertainment union Equity
OL,15,Fsaid threatened to "undermine          
OL,16,Feverything that makes The Archers so   
OL,17,Fspecial to millions of people."        
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
